      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\sin' x=\\cos x^{*}$. (1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(1)式是根据下面两点假设推出的（稍后就证明这两点假",
        "设的正确性）："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "а) 当自变量取所有的值时，",
        "函数$\\cos$是连续的，就是",
        "$\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\cos(x+\\Delta x)=\\cos x$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "б) $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sin x}{x}=1$."
      ]
    },
